# Changelog

Each pull request adds its line under `## Upcoming version`.
A release pull request renames that heading to the version and the day, such as `## 0.1.0 (2026-10-01)`, and edits the section into the release notes.
Merging it releases that version ([RELEASING.md]({{ github_url }}/blob/main/RELEASING.md)).

